===============================================================================
RUNTIME (dynamically linked from the host; NOT redistributed in this package)
===============================================================================

The bundled nginx binary dynamically links the following HOST system libraries —
they are provided by the operating system / base image and are NOT shipped in this
package (listed for completeness only):

  PCRE      (libpcre.so.3 / "libpcre3")     — BSD-2-Clause-like; https://www.pcre.org/licence.txt
  zlib      (libz.so.1 / "zlib1g")          — Zlib
  libcrypt  (libcrypt.so.1 / "libcrypt1")   — system C library component

(The C++ runtime — libstdc++/libgcc — and OpenSSL are STATICALLY linked into the
module, so they are not host runtime dependencies.)


